# sweep: --bare
# Everything past adding and ticking: tags, the Edit list and one item's
# screen (date, order, rename, remove), clearing finished items and its undo,
# reopening from Select, the copy for a computer, a refused save, a list long
# enough to page, and the list surviving a restart.
wait-for Nothing to do
# No Edit or Select over an empty list.
expect-missing Edit
expect-missing Select
tap Add a task
wait-for New item
type call mum #home
tap Add
wait-for Added
type fix bike #home
tap Add
wait-for Added
type send invoice #work
tap Add
wait-for Added
tap Back
wait-for send invoice #work
expect #home
expect #work
clean
shot todo-edit-tags
# A tag chip narrows the list, and a second tap widens it again.
tap #work
wait-for send invoice #work
expect-missing call mum
clean
shot todo-edit-filtered
tap #work
wait-for call mum #home
# A tap on a row finishes it, and it moves under Done.
tap fix bike
wait-for Done
expect Done. Tap to reopen.
expect Clear finished
# Clear finished, then the one undo it offers.
tap Clear finished
wait-for Undo clear
expect-missing fix bike
tap Undo clear
wait-for fix bike #home
expect Clear finished
# Select with only finished items ticked offers Reopen rather than Finish.
tap Select
wait-for Select items
tap fix bike
wait-for 1 selected
expect Reopen
tap Reopen
wait-for call mum #home
expect-missing Done. Tap to reopen.
expect-missing Clear finished
# Select, then Back, changes nothing.
tap Select
wait-for Select items
tap Select all
wait-for 3 selected
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Edit
expect-missing Done. Tap to reopen.
# The Edit list and one item's screen.
tap Edit
wait-for Edit list
expect Tap an item to rename it, move it, give it a date or remove it.
expect Save a copy
clean
shot todo-edit-list
tap send invoice #work
wait-for When it is due
expect Move up
clean
shot todo-edit-item
tap Tomorrow
wait-for due tomorrow
tap In a week
wait-for due in 7 days
tap Today
wait-for due today
tap No date
expect-missing due today
tap Tomorrow
wait-for due tomorrow
# The last item can move up but not down; after one move up it can do both.
tap Move up
wait-for Move down
clean
shot todo-edit-item-moved
# Rename keeps the item where it is.
tap Rename
wait-for Change the words
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type by friday
tap Save
wait-for send invoice by friday
expect due tomorrow
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Edit list
expect send invoice by friday
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for To do
# The renamed item sits second, above fix bike, and the #work chip went
# with the tag.
expect send invoice by friday
expect-missing #work
clean
shot todo-edit-renamed
# A copy for the computer, received by the companion.
tap Edit
wait-for Edit list
tap Save a copy
wait-for Ready for your computer.
expect TXT
clean
shot todo-edit-copy
companion export --app todo --sim --out target/todo-route-export
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Edit list
# Remove from one item's screen.
tap fix bike
wait-for When it is due
tap-id delete
wait-for Edit list
expect-missing fix bike
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for To do
expect-missing fix bike
# The list survives the app restarting, dates and order included.
restart
wait-for send invoice by friday
expect call mum #home
expect due tomorrow
expect-missing Done
# A save the reader refuses says so on the list, and the next good save
# takes the banner down.
scenario storage-full
tap call mum
wait-for The list could not be saved. Check free space.
clean
shot todo-edit-save-refused
scenario normal
tap call mum
wait-idle
wait 1000
# The banner should go once a save lands.
expect-missing The list could not be saved
